                            sprint complete writes the event through --record)
  sprint decisions related <path|t-xxxx>... [--limit N | --all]  The DECISIONS.md rows that name
                            those files or tickets (id, date, the rule); archive <row-id> --by
                            <t-xxxx> moves one whole row to DECISIONS-archive.md; mark <row-id>
                            <date> "<fragment>" appends superseded-by to one row (t-79bf)
  sprint close-hint <id>      Why a closed sprint's close was slow: one line from the activity log
