                              nothing for a close that was on time with no reruns (t-bc1e).
  sprint check-evidence <id>  Pre-flight before the evaluator: every stamped
                            evidence log is fresh with exit 0, or covered
                            (read-only; exit 1 names each log and the fix);
                            also lists evidence/manual-qa.md and refuses a
                            [manual] criterion with no fresh record (t-aa24)
  sprint manual-qa <id> --by "<who>" --step "<what>|pass|fail|n/a" ...
